5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe it is wise to see what has truly lasted. I shall review the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the human element. I will examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to understand the current state of our shared infrastructure. I will check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the real value of these grants is shifting. I will examine the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
